REGENT OF WONOGIRI

REGIONAL REGULATION OF WONOGIRI REGENCY NUMBER 2 OF 2013

CONCERNING

IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION FOR VICTIMS OF GENDER-BASED VIOLENCE AND CHILDREN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

REGENT OF WONOGIRI,

Considering : a. that based on Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection and Law Number 23 of 2004 concerning

Elimination of Domestic Violence, the Regional Government together with the community is obliged to undertake prevention, protection, and recovery efforts for victims of gender-based violence and children;

b. that to realize the provision of protection for victims of gender-based violence and children as well as to provide legal certainty particularly in the implementation of child protection in Wonogiri Regency, it is necessary to regulate this in a Regional

Regulation;

c. that based on the considerations as referred to in points a and b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning

Implementation of Protection for Victims of

Gender-Based Violence and Children.

In View of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;

2. Law Number 13 of 1950 concerning Establishment of Regency Regions Within the Province of Central Java (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1950 Number 42);

3. Law Number 4 of 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1979 Number 32, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3143);

4. Law Number 7 of 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (Convention on The Elimination of All Forms Discrimination Againts Women) (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1984 Number 29, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3668);

5. Law Number 4 of 1997 concerning Persons with Disabilities (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1997 Number 9, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3670);

6. Law Number 20 of 1999 concerning Ratification of the ILO Convention Concerning Minimum Age for Admission to Employment (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1999 Number 56, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3835);

7. Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);

